257 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 151 0 R
/T (-The convergence analysis highlights the algorithm's ability to evolve a solution over successive iterations.  -Under a Cold Start scenario, we observe a rapid initial progression where random assignments are quickly structured into efficient routes, followed by a stabilization phase as the algorithm approaches a plateau. -This behavior validates the effectiveness of our stochastic operator \(Move, Swap, and Reorder\) which work together with the cooling schedule to escape local optima.  -Ultimately, the plot confirms that the system effectively balances wide-scale exploration with fine-tuned exploitation to reach stable, high-quality results.)
/E (-The convergence analysis highlights the algorithm's ability to evolve a solution over successive iterations.  -Under a Cold Start scenario, we observe a rapid initial progression where random assignments are quickly structured into efficient routes, followed by a stabilization phase as the algorithm approaches a plateau. -This behavior validates the effectiveness of our stochastic operator \(Move, Swap, and Reorder\) which work together with the cooling schedule to escape local optima.  -Ultimately, the plot confirms that the system effectively balances wide-scale exploration with fine-tuned exploitation to reach stable, high-quality results.)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [3]
>>
