/Title (This project focuses on assigning a predefined list of customer rides to a fleet of autonomous vehicles operating on a grid-based city map, ensuring each ride starts and finishes within its time constraints while maximizing the global score through efficient routing, timely arrivals for bonus points, and strategic distribution of rides among vehicles. Each ride has a start point, an end point, an earliest start time, a latest finish time.)
/Dest [10 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 639 0 R
