<<
/Title (-The convergence analysis highlights the algorithm's ability to evolve a solution over successive iterations.  -Under a Cold Start scenario, we observe a rapid initial progression where random assignments are quickly structured into efficient routes, followed by a stabilization phase as the algorithm approaches a plateau. -This behavior validates the effectiveness of our stochastic operator \(Move, Swap, and Reorder\) which work together with the cooling schedule to escape local optima.  -Ultimately, the plot confirms that the system effectively balances wide-scale exploration with fine-tuned exploitation to reach stable, high-quality results.)
/Dest [16 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 780 0 R
>>
endobj
